          "block_content": "To unify the two sums, we substitute in the first case  $ x = 2u + 1 $,  $ y = 2v + 1 $,  $ z = 2w + 1 $ and in the second case  $ x = 2u + 2 $,  $ y = 2v + 2 $,  $ z = 2w + 2 $ to obtain",
