          "block_label": "display_formula",
          "block_content": " $$ \\begin{align*}\\sum_{(a,b,c)\\in T}\\frac{2^{a}}{3^{b}5^{c}}&=\\sum_{u,v,w=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{2^{\\nu+w}}{3^{w+u}5^{u+v}}\\left(1+\\frac{2^{-1}}{3^{-1}5^{-1}}\\right)\\\\&=\\frac{17}{2}\\sum_{u=1}^{\\infty}\\left(\\frac{1}{15}\\right)^{u}\\sum_{\\nu=1}^{\\infty}\\left(\\frac{2}{5}\\right)^{\\nu}\\sum_{w=1}^{\\infty}\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{w}\\\\&=\\frac{17}{2}\\frac{1/15}{1-1/15}\\frac{2/5}{1-2/5}\\frac{2/3}{1-2/3}\\\\&=\\frac{17}{21}.\\end{align*} $$ ",
