        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "So far we have assumed  $ n \\geq 3 $, but it is straightforward to extrapolate the sequences  $ P_n, U_n, V_n, W_n, T_n, S_n $ back to n = 2 to preserve the preceding identities. Hence for all  $ n \\geq 2 $,",
